<item><title>Boakai to sign US$5.7 billion Bea Mountain power and roads deal</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/lr/boakai-to-sign-us-5-7-billion-bea-mountain-power-and-roads-6e358a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/lr/boakai-to-sign-us-5-7-billion-bea-mountain-power-and-roads-6e358a/</guid><category>Liberia</category><description>The plan promises 270 MW of new generation, US$230 million for the grid and a 146 km road, with lawmakers next to decide whether to ratify it.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:13:17 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/lr/boakai-to-sign-us-5-7-billion-bea-mountain-power-and-roads-6e358a/share.jpg" length="42522" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/lr/boakai-to-sign-us-5-7-billion-bea-mountain-power-and-roads-6e358a/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
